OL,3,GNEWSADisabled footballers' delight at
OL,4,Atown bus parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football team which won a gold medal
OL,7,Fat the Special Olympics have been
OL,8,Fhonoured with a surprise open-top bus
OL,9,Fparade in their home town.
OL,11,FThe event was organised in Scunthorpe
OL,12,Fafter Bottesford Town FC's Lions side
OL,13,Fwon gold at the GB National Summer
OL,14,FGames in Birmingham in August.
OL,16,FPlayers travelled through the town on
OL,17,FFriday waving to supporters after a
OL,18,Fcampaign which saw the Lions win all
OL,19,Fseven of their matches.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
